WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.320
<i>Many things happened at a very rapid pace.</i>

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:10.820
<i>Having earned official permission from 
the crown prince and the temple,</i>

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.610
<i>I set off with my team of rowdy adventurers</i>

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.720
<i>to begin the process of exterminating 
the dangerous demons</i>

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.110
<i>and demon beasts infesting Beast Woods.</i>

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:21.970
<i>For areas that were relatively safe,</i>

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>we brought human resources and supplies, 
two things every poor village needs.</i>

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:28.300
The village is within sight!

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.880
Yeah!

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.940
<i>A village with access to supplies 
becomes more productive.</i>

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.610
<i>Even if it starts out in debt, 
it should eventually make a profit.</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.470
<i>Tonio handled all that 
with remarkable skill.</i>

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:48.500
<i>It was also Tonio who funded our activities 
by soliciting donations and contributions.</i>

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.950
I could go on to become the 
head of a trade company.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.610
Feel free to go big!

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:57.440
When I do, I'll be counting on your patronage.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.430
<i>Officially, this is just a lone 
priest doing charitable work,</i>

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.040
<i>so no one gets offended.</i>

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>Of course, that means I need to remain loyal 
to the crown prince and the temple, though.</i>

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:22.140
The Faraway Paladin

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.310
Will, you're back.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.030
I appreciate the work all of you have done.

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:57.540
<i>Bishop Bagley assigned a few 
priests to me, including Anna.</i>

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.280
<i>They're all experienced priests</i>

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.950
<i>who can use the blessing, 
as well as lead ceremonies</i>

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.750
<i>such as festivals and funerals.</i>

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.040
Reystov's party should be 
returning soon, as well.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.710
<i>When we got reports about demons 
or demon beasts appearing,</i>

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:17.330
<i>Reystov and the other adventurers 
would pursue them as a party.</i>

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.500
Incredible... They were all killed 
with a single fatal blow!

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:24.360
<i>No wonder they call him the Penetrator.</i>

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.940
Can you do this to wyverns, too?

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.330
If it's within range of my sword.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.940
<i>I would intervene in any 
disputes between villagers</i>

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.220
<i>and try to help them settle 
things reasonably.</i>

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:41.040
I wasn't planning to do all this...

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:45.110
Well, once you've done it the 
first time, you're kinda stuck.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.370
<i>Word of my interventions spread,</i>

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.180
<i>and I was called to intervene 
in other villages' disputes.</i>

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:53.190
<i>My sudden role as an arbitrator 
gave me a lot more to do.</i>

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:57.390
<i>And whenever I had to visit other 
villages for friendly purposes</i>

00:03:57.390 --> 00:03:59.760
<i>or had a message I wanted to get out,</i>

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.940
<i>Bee was a big help.</i>

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:30.990
<i>And so we traveled back and forth across 
Beast Woods, time and time again.</i>

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.630
Mom, this way!

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.970
The atmosphere has changed so much.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.070
This area is relatively safe now,

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.400
so there's more merchant traffic.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.870
<i>A village that once had such 
a dark cloud hanging over it</i>

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.880
<i>was now full of life and smiles.</i>

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.820
<i>Gus, I finally understand now.</i>

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.070
Money drives this world!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:06.940
With the power of money, you can 
solve anything without magic!

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.540
You can buy the necessary 
tools, hire people...

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:14.620
The ability to make a quick profit 
is just as important as magic!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:19.260
<i>Everything you taught me was exactly right.</i>

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:22.820
<i>Making people smile and giving them hope</i>

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.990
<i>is more magical than actual magic.</i>

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:30.930
<i>And then...</i>

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:34.920
<i>Just as we were feeling the first 
signs of summer approaching...</i>

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:37.630
Hey.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:38.860
What is it?

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:43.070
Pip's party went west on recon, 
and they're not back yet.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:44.310
How long?

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:47.880
They were planning to spend no 
more than ten days investigating,

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.770
but it's two days past that.

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:51.440
So Pip and his party...

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:53.310
They're talented guys.

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:56.430
All right. We'll go and search for them.

00:05:56.990 --> 00:06:00.640
You, Menel, and I are 
definitely going, and...

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:06.060
Could you put together two parties of 
people who excel in forest exploration?

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.910
I'll get them together right away.

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:13.920
There's a chance that

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:16.740
they didn't simply get lost, 
but wound up in the demons' base.

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:18.690
If that's the case...

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.300
There'll be a battle.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.110
What do you think?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.820
Frankly, given the skills 
Pip and his buddies have,

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.960
it's hard to believe they just got lost.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.610
So you think it was demons, then?

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:36.440
I think there's a good chance it was.

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:39.670
If we beat them, 
things'll settle down a bit here, too.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.680
I just hope they're all right.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:42.790
Hey...

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.630
What?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:47.980
I guess I should say... thanks.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:51.220
Uh... For what?

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:52.980
A lot of things.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:57.290
If it hadn't been for you, 
I would've sunk as low as I could sink.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:02.620
It's thanks to you that I'm here now, 
living for a respectable reason.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.510
So... uh...

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:08.260
Thanks.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.580
No, I should thank you.

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:14.100
I knew nothing of the world, 
and you saved me.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:15.830
But you know...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.240
What?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.870
You could look at me and say it.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.210
Shut up!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.590
Hey.

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.560
It's huge...

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.150
What kind of demon beast made this?

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.280
I don't know.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.600
It's even bigger than a manticore.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.270
A stray living in the valley... or...

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:00.890
Well, they died fighting a big one.

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:04.030
Pip, Harvey, and Brennan must 
be pretty happy with that,

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.170
but pretty pissed off, too.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.510
Yeah, like, "We didn't get to kill it!"

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:11.480
They died a good death, 
worthy of adventurers.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.060
G'wan, drink up.

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:18.240
Virtuous gods, grant their souls rest!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:21.190
Gracefeel, goddess of light,

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:22.820
please grant them peace and guidance.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.240
There's a head missing.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:30.030
The damage is so bad, 
it's hard to tell, but...

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.860
It probably got eaten.

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.250
Yeah, I'd bet on it.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.370
No, wait.

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:39.070
He tossed all his gear as he ran?

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:41.080
Why go deeper into the valley, though?

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:44.180
If the path to the forest is blocked, 
this valley's the only way.

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:46.400
He had no choice but to run deeper down.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:48.050
I guess that's true...

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.710
Something's strange.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.770
Yeah.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.010
It's not right.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:09.260
What's not right?

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:12.840
The footing in this valley is poor.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:15.280
Even if they fled, getting this far would be...

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.240
It's a trap!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:20.190
Get out!

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.170
Get back!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:27.990
It's no use!

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:28.800
They're coming!

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:30.670
Stay calm! Keep your backs to the rocks!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.810
Don't panic! Form a shield wall!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.170
<i>We have to break through them.</i>

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:42.620
<i>It'll be fine! We should be 
able to handle these guys!</i>

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.220
Menel!

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:48.110
Yeah?

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:50.050
I'll give us a boost with 
magic and the blessing!

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:54.080
Goddess of flux, repel the 
poisons that rain down upon us!

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.040
Fortis...

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:54.820
Strong

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.320
Life to

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.320
Vita ut Omnis!

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.200
All

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.520
Much appreciated!

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.690
Thanks!

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:03.760
Gnomes, O gnomes, guardians of treasure,

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.380
link to form a stronghold 
against our enemies.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.100
Sylphs, Sylphs, maidens of wind,

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.450
send your winds of protection 
for these brave warriors.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.040
Much obliged!

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:18.390
Now, let's show these beasts who 
think they've trapped us...

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:21.890
which of us is really the prey.

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:30.550
Shoot!

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:36.820
Hang in there!

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.420
Menel, help!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.540
Gnomes, O gnomes,

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.780
gather to us!

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:58.160
Build a fortress and surround with fences!

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.170
<i>If he can just buy me time...</i>

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:11.150
Don't...

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.140
Stop!

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:20.970
Stop!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.330
Thunder...

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:28.340
Tonit—

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.010
<i>It cut my Words short!</i>

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:34.970
What happened?!

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:35.870
He misfired?!

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:40.580
<i>Why...</i>

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:45.490
<i>Everything was going so well up until now.</i>

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:47.150
<i>And yet...</i>

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:50.110
<i>Where did I...</i>

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.460
<i>What did I do wrong?</i>

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.070
William!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.050
<i>The techniques that I had honed...</i>

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.540
<i>The spirit that I had refined...</i>

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:24.310
<i>The tactics that I had accumulated...</i>

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.130
<i>None of it was there.</i>

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:29.530
<i>All I could rely on</i>

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:34.260
<i>was blind fury and the abilities 
of my demonblade as I hacked away</i>

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:42.270
<i>in an ugly, unsightly battle 
that made me want to cry.</i>

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:59.800
<i>I felt I had wronged the three of them.</i>

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.200
<i>I felt pathetic.</i>

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.300
Stop! That's enough!

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.250
Go heal Meneldor, quick! He's gonna die!

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:25.830
Menel!

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:40.460
Gracefeel, goddess of light...

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.290
Shine this healthy soul's light

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:45.100
upon these wicked wounds,

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.200
and banish these shadows!

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:49.720
Please...

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:52.740
Open your eyes!

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:56.010
No! Don't leave me!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.470
<i>My head feels fuzzy.</i>

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:01.680
<i>Because I used the demonblade's power?</i>

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:08.610
<i>But... I have to heal Menel...</i>

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:15.950
Episode 11
Valley of Despair

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:11.510
William!

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:12.510
Snap out of it!

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:29.630
You're awake?

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.570
Where...

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:34.960
A village not far from that valley.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:43.620
After that battle, we retreated with 
you and Meneldor on our backs.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:46.600
The chimera fled.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:48.780
I se—

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.320
Where's Menel?!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.930
He's still alive.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:56.190
Between the magic and protection 
you put on him before the fight

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:58.660
and Meneldor's own quick retreat,

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.920
it seems like your blessing 
was just in the nick of time.

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:03.660
Thank goodness...

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:06.110
He hasn't woken up yet, though.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:07.920
Then, I have to go to him!

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.170
You need to rest a bit longer.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:12.670
But—

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:15.340
Meneldor's condition is stable.

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:16.920
He's had all the care he needs.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:20.820
You burned up too much strength.

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:22.470
So rest.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.960
<i>Where did I screw up?</i>

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.610
<i>When I left Menel to handle the chimera?</i>

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.150
<i>No...</i>

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.700
<i>Given the circumstances, 
I didn't have any other choice.</i>

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.330
<i>Then, when was it?</i>

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:49.990
<i>Was it getting caught in that 
trap in the first place?</i>

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:53.480
<i>If I had been more careful</i>

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:56.860
<i>and taken the time to send out 
scouts in all directions,</i>

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:59.660
<i>we wouldn't have wandered 
blindly into that valley.</i>

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:03.760
<i>We had plenty of people, 
we'd been successful up to that point,</i>

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:08.970
<i>and we were rattled after 
seeing some of our men dead.</i>

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:13.610
<i>All of that led to a simple lack of caution.</i>

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:19.720
No, I think I'm missing something... 
some fatal flaw...

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.360
Anyway, they retreated, huh?

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:25.080
The Wyvern Killer and the Penetrator?

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.600
I heard they ran into some absurdly huge 
mixed-up demon beast called a chimera.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:30.130
Wonder what they're gonna do.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:33.520
Also, that elf mix was hurt bad, wasn't he?

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:35.950
Yeah, he's really got it rough.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:39.000
When you're stuck with a monster 
like the Wyvern Killer,

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:41.300
no amount of lives is ever gonna be enough.

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.380
Yeah.

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.780
A monster?

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:48.040
Yeah... I guess I am.

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:58.580
<i>It wasn't my battle tactics that were wrong.</i>

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.830
<i>It was my estimation of our strength.</i>

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:03.520
<i>I trusted Menel.</i>

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:06.380
<i>I just believed that he'd have my back,</i>

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:10.510
<i>that he could keep any 
enemy in check for me.</i>

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:14.570
<i>I thought he could handle 
that much... but...</i>

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:19.290
<i>I came so close to getting Menel killed.</i>

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:23.820
<i>I just one-sidedly decided he was my friend,</i>

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:28.170
<i>and in my innocent naïveté, 
without even thinking,</i>

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:30.600
<i>I put him up against dangers 
he wasn't ready for.</i>

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:33.860
Will!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.880
Bee... Tonio.

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:39.360
We got your message and rushed here.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:44.340
Anna should arrive here 
with the priests later.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:46.400
I see.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.170
Will, we heard you saved Menel's life!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.260
You ran into a beast as 
impossibly tough as a chimera,

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:56.700
but you still beat an insane 
number of magic beasts

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.620
and even saved Menel's life!

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.420
You really are incredible!

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:06.190
I doubt Menel and the others who've 
been stuck with me would agree.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:07.080
Huh?

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.620
I'm going to check on Menel.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:11.330
Will?

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:15.660
Will, shouldn't you rest a bit longer?

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.020
I'm fine.

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:20.930
I'm very strong, after all.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.030
<i>Ever since I left the city of the dead,</i>

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:34.420
<i>people have constantly told me 
that in no uncertain terms.</i>

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:39.510
<i>Every time, I've just laughed 
wryly and shrugged it off.</i>

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:44.650
<i>I think, subconsciously, I was 
trying not to think about it.</i>

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:48.090
<i>But I can't avoid it anymore.</i>

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:54.290
<i>In this world, 
my strength is beyond the pale.</i>

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.680
<i>This is... my sin.</i>

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:16.970
Menel... I'll fix you up right now.

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:22.490
<i>Gods, please take pity 
on Menel and heal him.</i>

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.150
<i>I'm sorry, Menel.</i>

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:29.860
<i>I wanted a friend who could be my equal.</i>

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:32.300
<i>I wanted what the three of them had,</i>

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:35.080
<i>comrades who had each other's backs, 
supported each other,</i>

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:37.160
<i>and respected each other.</i>

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.570
<i>But maybe I was forcing that on you</i>

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:43.340
<i>without even realizing it.</i>

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:47.700
<i>I didn't want to acknowledge 
just how strong I was.</i>

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:50.890
<i>If I did that...</i>

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:53.160
<i>If I set myself above everyone else</i>

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:56.140
<i>and had to admit that I was different...</i>

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:58.610
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:01.400
<i>I'm lonely.</i>

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:03.980
<i>It hurts.</i>

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:06.040
<i>I hate this.</i>

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:10.270
<i>Oh... Of course.</i>

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.440
<i>It was just that simple.</i>

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.840
<i>I was afraid to be alone.</i>

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:19.910
<i>I couldn't bear not having 
someone beside me.</i>

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:23.940
<i>That's why I tried to see the people 
I should have been protecting,</i>

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:28.080
<i>should have been saving, as my equals.</i>

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:31.420
<i>I was averting my eyes from the truth,</i>

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:34.900
<i>when really, I was just scared.</i>

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.750
<i>And for that despicable reason...</i>

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:39.170
<i>Because of that...</i>

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.240
I almost killed you.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:47.080
But I finally get it now.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.660
I couldn't go on that way.

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:57.860
Oh, Goddess.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.240
You're here because you're worried about me?

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:03.650
Up until now, I was foolish.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.830
But everything is fine now.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.720
Please rest at ease.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:11.840
I'll put a stop to your sadness right away.

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:15.600
I'll save everything, 
everything within my reach,

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:20.960
as your sword, and as your hand.

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:22.630
It's all right.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:26.790
I'll solve all of this on my own.

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:31.710
Will...

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:39.970
Episode 12
The Faraway Paladin
